ause of this, we're unable to review all of the translated text. While we've worked hard to improve the translations, they may still not be perfect.To address this, the tutorial now uses non-verbal visual cues so that pla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:37:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043367","verified_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4298710-1842846814455129","game_id":"steam-4298710","kind":"update","title":"DEMO - v0.3.0 Patch Note","summary":"Hello, this is Espero Studio.Here are the patch notes for v0.3.0 Demo.1. Heavy Attack Mechanism ChangesWe judged that the existing 3-charge-based heavy attack mechanism didn't fit MEHEN, where players need to respond to fast-paced enemy attacks with guard/parry/counter.This is because charging the heavy attack up to 3 stages by any means other than parrying leaves the player vulnerable to enemy attacks (since you can't guard while charging a heavy attack), and there simply isn't enough absolute ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T09:35:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4298710-1840944183780073","game_id":"steam-4298710","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO Announcement","summary":"Hello. This is Espero Studio.Demo Release DateThe demo will be released on August 26, 2026 at 00:00 (PDT). Demo ScopeTutorialBasic Combat TutorialAfterimage of Leo Boss Fight (Leo, Round 1)Counter TutorialBoss FightsLeo Boss Fight (Leo, Round 2)Gemini Boss FightTrialsTrial of HeraldTrial of BeastTrial of LordTrial of GiantEquipment16 Artifacts4 Alchemy ManualsDifferences from the Playtest1) Ad